  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Bamiyan? AFG</p>\r\n<p>Tarn suggested that Cartana be located at Bamiyan while Cunningham supported the theory that Cartana-Tetragonis should be located at Begram. Fraser refutes Cunningham's assertion based on archaeological evidence from Begram.</p>",
